                                    <h1>Book a Free Skincare D2C Strategy Call + Audit (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fef2f2;border-left:4px solid #ec4899;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#db2777;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD SKINCARE + BEAUTY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live skincare + beauty vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for skincare brands</a> with 4+ published D2C beauty brand case studies including <a href="/resources/Kama_Ayurveda_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Kama Ayurveda</a>, <a href="/resources/Plum_Beauty_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Plum Beauty</a>, <a href="/resources/Sugar_Cosmetics_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Sugar Cosmetics</a>, and <a href="/resources/WOW_Skin_Science_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">WOW Skin Science</a>. Plus <a href="/resources/How_Nykaa_Built_India_Largest_Beauty_Brand_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Nykaa growth story</a>, <a href="/resources/Ayurveda_Traditional_Wellness_D2C_India_Global_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Ayurveda D2C playbook</a>, seasonal <a href="/resources/Summer_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Summer</a> + <a href="/resources/Winter_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Winter Skincare</a> playbooks, and 11 GCC city-specific beauty pages (<a href="/services/gcc/dubai-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/riyadh-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Riyadh</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, Abu Dhabi, Dammam, Al Khobar, Kuwait City, Manama, Muscat, Ras al Khaimah). Every framework below is grounded in live category work.</div><p>The best way to evaluate ITD as your skincare marketing partner is a 30-minute Calendly discovery call + free audit. No obligation. No sales pressure. Walk out with a customised 90-day plan + budget benchmark + scoped proposal within 3 business days. This piece explains what to expect + what to prepare.</p>
                                    <h2>What free audit covers</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Brand + positioning review</strong> &mdash; one-sentence positioning clarity + sub-vertical fit + differentiator + competitive gap</li><li><strong>Funnel review</strong> &mdash; discovery + landing + PDP + subscription + WhatsApp + retention + LTV/CAC snapshot</li><li><strong>Attribution + reporting review</strong> &mdash; current attribution setup + gaps + LTV / CAC / cohort methodology recommendations</li><li><strong>Sub-vertical + geography fit</strong> &mdash; India + GCC + international opportunity mapping + capital + team fit</li><li><strong>Compliance review</strong> &mdash; CDSCO + ASCI + ESMA + SFDA + halal current status + gaps + remediation priorities</li><li><strong>Creative + content library review</strong> &mdash; velocity + fatigue + concern-specific + ingredient-messaging + creator + UGC gaps</li><li><strong>Shopify + tech stack review</strong> &mdash; theme + apps + skin quiz + subscription + WhatsApp + certification + AR + speed + multi-region readiness</li><li><strong>Team + agency review</strong> &mdash; in-house + agency + freelance current mix + gaps + right-sizing recommendations</li></ul>
                                    <h2>What to prepare before the call</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Shopify URL (or plan for launch)</li><li>Recent 3-month revenue + AOV + CAC + LTV + repeat rate (if operating)</li><li>Sub-vertical focus (clean / ayurveda / clinical / K-beauty / men's / colour / halal)</li><li>Target geography (India Tier 1 / 2 / 3, GCC country breakdown, international)</li><li>Current agency + team + freelance mix</li><li>Marketing + tech budget target (retainer + ad spend + tooling + creator)</li><li>90-day + 12-month + 24-month revenue + brand ambition</li><li>Any specific pain point (CPL climbing, retention weak, launch stalling, GCC entry, compliance)</li></ul><p>Not all needed &mdash; whatever available. More context = deeper audit + more actionable proposal.</p>
                                    <h2>Discovery call agenda (30 minutes)</h2>
                                    <ol style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Minutes 0-5:</strong> Founder + team introductions + context</li><li><strong>Minutes 5-15:</strong> Brand + funnel + attribution + tech stack walkthrough</li><li><strong>Minutes 15-22:</strong> Sub-vertical + geography + revenue trajectory + ambition + pain points</li><li><strong>Minutes 22-27:</strong> Live audit + 3-5 immediate actionable observations</li><li><strong>Minutes 27-30:</strong> Next steps + proposal timeline + Q&amp;A</li></ol><p>90-minute deep-dive optional for Enterprise-tier or complex multi-region brands.</p>
                                    <h2>What you get within 3 business days</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Written scoped proposal</strong> &mdash; recommended tier + 90-day plan + team + deliverables + timeline</li><li><strong>Budget benchmark</strong> &mdash; retainer + ad spend + tooling + creator + Shopify + total year-1 investment</li><li><strong>KPI framework</strong> &mdash; CAC + LTV + revenue + CPL + ROAS + cohort retention + attribution methodology</li><li><strong>Team composition</strong> &mdash; named individuals + org chart + hours per role</li><li><strong>Contract term sheet</strong> &mdash; 6-month MSA + cancellation after 3 + ad spend transparent + 100% client IP + fair exit</li><li><strong>References</strong> &mdash; 2-3 past + current skincare client references (under NDA)</li><li><strong>Case study review</strong> &mdash; Kama Ayurveda + Plum + Sugar + WOW Skin Science analyses relevant to your brand</li></ul><p>Proposal is starting point for negotiation + refinement. Standard 2-3 rounds of iteration before signing.</p>
                                    <h2>What happens after signing</h2>
                                    <ol style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Week 1:</strong> Kickoff + team introductions + brand + funnel + attribution deep-dive + 90-day plan finalisation</li><li><strong>Week 2-4:</strong> Attribution setup + creative + content pipeline + campaign structure + WhatsApp + subscription setup</li><li><strong>Week 5-8:</strong> First-month optimisation + creative iteration + LTV / CAC / cohort baseline + first monthly QBR</li><li><strong>Week 9-12:</strong> Second-month scaling + creative velocity + subscription optimisation + second monthly QBR + Q1 review + Q2 planning</li></ol><p>90-day milestone: measurable CPL + ROAS + revenue trajectory improvement + attribution baseline + creative + subscription programme in market.</p>
                                    <h2>Common questions on discovery call</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>"Can you guarantee X ROAS?" &mdash; No. Legitimate agencies do NOT guarantee. Platform + market + brand + creative determine.</li><li>"Do you work with our competitor X?" &mdash; ITD full disclosure + conflict policy discussion. Some sub-verticals ITD limits to 1-2 brands per sub-sub-vertical.</li><li>"What is your minimum engagement?" &mdash; Rs 65K/month Starter (6-month MSA). Below that, freelance + solo consultants more cost-appropriate.</li><li>"How soon can we start?" &mdash; 2-4 weeks from signing to kickoff (contract + payment + team assignment + attribution setup).</li><li>"Do you handle just one channel (Meta only OR SEO only)?" &mdash; Yes at Starter tier. Growth + Enterprise typically full-stack for compounding effect.</li><li>"Can we start with 3-month pilot?" &mdash; Not standard. 6-month MSA + cancellation after month 3 delivers same optionality with better team continuity + attribution depth + creative velocity.</li></ul>

