                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How do I book a discovery call with ITD?</h3>
                                        <p>Book free 30-minute Calendly discovery via <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>. WhatsApp + email + Contact form + LinkedIn also work &mdash; Calendly fastest.</p>
                                        <h3>Is the audit truly free?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. No obligation. No sales pressure. No cost. Walk out with 3-5 immediate actionable observations + written scoped proposal within 3 business days. Some brands take the proposal + implement in-house or with another agency &mdash; that is fine.</p>
