                                        <p>Week 1 kickoff + brand + funnel + attribution deep-dive + 90-day plan finalisation. Week 2-4 attribution setup + creative + content pipeline + campaign + WhatsApp + subscription setup. Week 5-8 first-month optimisation + first QBR. Week 9-12 second-month scaling + Q1 review + Q2 planning. 90-day milestone = measurable improvement + attribution baseline.</p>
